.TH check 1  "check " 
.SH NAME
check \- Check consistency, evidence, accountability, and graph quality
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcheck\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check consistency, evidence, accountability, and graph quality
.PP
Evaluates whether the repository is healthy: mechanical consistency, evidence coverage, artifact accountability baselines, and graph quality advisories.
.PP
Machine JSON supported: \-\-json flag.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH "EVERYDAY WORKFLOW"
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured machine JSON envelope
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
Display compact single\-line summary
